  "translation": "Yerra-d ɣer uceṛṛeḍ n wexxam, walakini ⟨ar⟩ tura: waman reffɣen-d deg seddar n useqqi n wexxam, ɣer lqibla taqdimt (iḥerrek ɣer lqibla taqdimt), maca d lqibla i d-tella deg tama n lqibla taqdimt i ḥerben ɣer wexxam. Waman i d-yeffɣen si ṭṭerf ayeffus n wexxam, ayen i d-yeffɣen si tama n lqibla tunṣibt, ɣer lqibla taqdimt, si tama n yiwen n wexxam n lqibla n ccemɛa.",
